## Folder and file organization

**Backend**

- [`backend/src/index.ts`](backend/src/index.ts) — `express()` app wiring: JSON body parser, attaches **`PrismaClient` on `req.prisma`** (extended `Express.Request`), CORS (`http://localhost:3000`), route mounts, trivial request logging middleware, global error handler, `listen(3010)`.
- **`routes/`** — one file per resource area (currently `candidateRoutes.ts`). **`presentation/controllers/`** — `*Controller.ts`. **`application/services/`** — `*Service.ts`. **`domain/models/`** — one file per Prisma-aligned entity (`Candidate.ts`, `Education.ts`, …).
- **`backend/prisma/`** — schema, migrations, [`seed.ts`](backend/prisma/seed.ts).

**Frontend**

- `frontend/src/services/` — API helpers (e.g. [`candidateService.js`](frontend/src/services/candidateService.js)).
- `frontend/src/components/` — UI components (`*.js`).

**Documentation / API**

- [`backend/api-spec.yaml`](backend/api-spec.yaml) — OpenAPI-style description for candidates and `/upload`; **preferred source when extending HTTP contracts** alongside route code.

